t into mitochondria through TOM/TIM complex where it is degraded by mitophagy (PubMed:36828120)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}